   216                                  ; ---- plain AVX2, c4 layout ----------------------------------------------
   217                                  ; vpmaddubsw (u8 x s8 -> pairs summed to s16) cannot saturate while x <= 127:
   218                                  ; the extreme pair sums are 2*127*127 = 32258 and 2*127*(-128) = -32512.
